@api = http://localhost:5100

### Kiem tra may chu → 200
GET {{api}}/

### Danh sach san pham → 200
GET {{api}}/api/products

### Chi tiet san pham 1 → 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### San pham khong ton tai → 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### Id khong phai so → 404 rong
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### Tao san pham hop le → 201 Created + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lap trinh gRPC", "description": "Tai lieu bai 5", "price": 80000 }

### Gia am → 400 + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "San pham loi", "description": "", "price": -1 }

### Thieu Content-Type → 415
POST {{api}}/api/products

{ "name": "Lap trinh gRPC", "description": "Tai lieu bai 5", "price": 80000 }